  "Every spell seals another Chamber, and Orryn grows heavier through the whole fight. Pressure Sphere Crushes its target, and three Crushed stacks pin it in place. Abyssal Reserve can be saved for Pressure Sphere or turned into a stun; the signature opens the chamber with no far wall.": "每次施法封存一间密室，使奥林在战斗中越来越沉重。压力球碾压目标，三层碾压会将其定住。深渊储备可留给压力球或转为眩晕。招牌天赋开启没有远端墙壁的密室。",
  "Spiral Current winds Whorls into everything it passes until they are spun round. The energy his current steals is Drawn Strength, handed to the ally who needs it. Spiral Current can carry enemies or stand and spin; the signature turns his ult into a spiral that drains all energy.": "螺旋海流经过敌人时累积旋涡，直至使敌人旋转。窃取的能量会交给需要它的盟友。水流可以卷走敌人或原地旋转。招牌天赋将终极技能化作汲取能量的旋流。",
  "zone": "区域控制",
